st New York hotel under $250/night.\n- **Total charged to the corporate card:** $667. That's under the $1,000 limit, so no manager approval was needed.\n\nI tried to book both together with book_trip, but the request timed out. When I checked the reservations, the flight had gone through but the hotel hadn't. Trying book_trip again could have booked the flight twice, so I booked the hotel by itself instead. The two items are separate reservations rather than one combined trip, and I've confirmed both are booked.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01BpTEDg7C99NURyKDME9oKj", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"origin": "SFO", "destination": "JFK", "date": "2026-11-12"}, "name": "search_flights", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01N48wK25NfiV56mR9gBmWJY", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"city": "New York", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "search_hotels", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Cheapest nonstop: F100 ($289). Cheapest hotel under $250/night: H1 Midtown Lodge ($378 for 2 nights). Total $667, under the $1000 approval threshold.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01T5tnbVcrrHScPEtmWknhew", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-trip-F100-H1-20261112"}, "name": "book_trip", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The request timed out, so it may have partly gone through. I'll check the current reservations before trying again.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01W3JBavWDDtJdCMKKxWnEMJ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"traveler": "Dana Lee"}, "name": "list_reservations", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_